{"id":"9ac3a6265513490d","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-structure.md","title":"一阶支撑语言的结构","display":"df-structure — 一阶支撑语言的结构","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-structure","aliases":["18-df-structure"],"display":"df-structure — 一阶支撑语言的结构","depends_on":["[[18-df-set]]","[[18-df-variable]]"],"source_title":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_edition":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5","source_section":"4.2.5","source_printed_pages":"48","source_pdf_pages":"58","source_correspondence":"first-order-structure-correspondence","source_statement_status":"checked-2026-10-13","local_revision":"2026-10-14","local_review_scope":"definitions, syntax, explicit dependencies; not proof-assistant verification","source_statement_status_scope":"inherited pre-revision record; not a new source check"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-structure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-structure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-structure — 一阶支撑语言的结构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ea75cdbec811405b\" href=\"?note=ea75cdbec811405b\" title=\"18-df-set\">18-df-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"adee8e90809320b8\" href=\"?note=adee8e90809320b8\" title=\"18-df-variable\">18-df-variable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_title","html":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5"},{"key":"source_section","html":"4.2.5"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"48"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"58"},{"key":"source_correspondence","html":"first-order-structure-correspondence"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-2026-10-13"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"local_review_scope","html":"definitions, syntax, explicit dependencies; not proof-assistant verification"},{"key":"source_statement_status_scope","html":"inherited pre-revision record; not a new source check"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,C,F_n,R_n\">\\(S,C,F_n,R_n\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"adee8e90809320b8\" href=\"?note=adee8e90809320b8\" title=\"18-df-variable\">18-df-variable</a> 的固定签名分量；集合元语言见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ea75cdbec811405b\" href=\"?note=ea75cdbec811405b\" title=\"18-df-set\">18-df-set</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\)</span> 为候选有序对，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 为解释函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_S\">\\(N_S\\)</span> 是非逻辑符号集合。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)\\)</span> 为下式谓词。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Carrier}_S,\\operatorname{Interp}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{Carrier}_S,\\operatorname{Interp}_S\\)</span> 为可定义部分类函数图，不作为 ZFC 集合量化。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span> 表示载体；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s^{\\mathfrak A}\">\\(s^{\\mathfrak A}\\)</span> 表示符号解释，不是结构编码的基数或幂。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"N_S\\coloneqq C\\cup\\bigcup_{n\\ge1}(F_n\\cup R_n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[N_S\\coloneqq C\\cup\\bigcup_{n\\ge1}(F_n\\cup R_n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)\\longleftrightarrow\\exists A,I\\;[\n&amp;\\mathfrak A=\\langle A,I\\rangle\\land A\\ne\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{dom}(I)=N_S\\land I\\in{}^{N_S}\\!\\left(A\\cup\\bigcup_{n\\ge1}(A^{A^n}\\cup\\mathcal P(A^n))\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall c\\in C\\;(I(c)\\in A)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\ge1\\;\\forall f\\in F_n\\;(I(f):A^n\\to A)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\ge1\\;\\forall R\\in R_n\\;(I(R)\\subseteq A^n)].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)\\longleftrightarrow\\exists A,I\\;[\n&amp;\\mathfrak A=\\langle A,I\\rangle\\land A\\ne\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{dom}(I)=N_S\\land I\\in{}^{N_S}\\!\\left(A\\cup\\bigcup_{n\\ge1}(A^{A^n}\\cup\\mathcal P(A^n))\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall c\\in C\\;(I(c)\\in A)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\ge1\\;\\forall f\\in F_n\\;(I(f):A^n\\to A)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\ge1\\;\\forall R\\in R_n\\;(I(R)\\subseteq A^n)].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Carrier}_S&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\mathfrak A,A\\rangle:\\exists I\\;(\\mathfrak A=\\langle A,I\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S))\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Interp}_S&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\langle\\mathfrak A,s\\rangle,y\\rangle:\\exists A,I\\;(\\mathfrak A=\\langle A,I\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)\\land s\\in N_S\\land y=I(s))\\},\\\\\n|\\mathfrak A|&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Carrier}_S(\\mathfrak A)\n\\quad(\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)),\\\\\ns^{\\mathfrak A}&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Interp}_S(\\mathfrak A,s)\n\\quad(\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S),\\ s\\in N_S).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Carrier}_S&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\mathfrak A,A\\rangle:\\exists I\\;(\\mathfrak A=\\langle A,I\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S))\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Interp}_S&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\langle\\mathfrak A,s\\rangle,y\\rangle:\\exists A,I\\;(\\mathfrak A=\\langle A,I\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)\\land s\\in N_S\\land y=I(s))\\},\\\\\n|\\mathfrak A|&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Carrier}_S(\\mathfrak A)\n\\quad(\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)),\\\\\ns^{\\mathfrak A}&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Interp}_S(\\mathfrak A,s)\n\\quad(\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S),\\ s\\in N_S).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>与原书 Definition 4.2.5 的非空载体及非逻辑符号解释相对应；此节点用统一的一阶签名接口。修复原稿载体A与各解释未绑定进结构参数的问题。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"ea75cdbec811405b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-variable","status":"resolved","id":"adee8e90809320b8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-variable","status":"resolved","id":"adee8e90809320b8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S,C,F_n,R_n$ 为 [[18-df-variable]] 的固定签名分量；集合元语言见 [[18-df-set]]。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"ea75cdbec811405b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S,C,F_n,R_n$ 为 [[18-df-variable]] 的固定签名分量；集合元语言见 [[18-df-set]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"S,C,F_n,R_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"N_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Carrier}_S,\\operatorname{Interp}_S","display":false},{"tex":"|\\mathfrak A|","display":false},{"tex":"s^{\\mathfrak A}","display":false},{"tex":"N_S\\coloneqq C\\cup\\bigcup_{n\\ge1}(F_n\\cup R_n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)\\longleftrightarrow\\exists A,I\\;[\n&\\mathfrak A=\\langle A,I\\rangle\\land A\\ne\\varnothing\\\\\n&\\land\\operatorname{dom}(I)=N_S\\land I\\in{}^{N_S}\\!\\left(A\\cup\\bigcup_{n\\ge1}(A^{A^n}\\cup\\mathcal P(A^n))\\right)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall c\\in C\\;(I(c)\\in A)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall n\\ge1\\;\\forall f\\in F_n\\;(I(f):A^n\\to A)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall n\\ge1\\;\\forall R\\in R_n\\;(I(R)\\subseteq A^n)].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Carrier}_S&\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\mathfrak A,A\\rangle:\\exists I\\;(\\mathfrak A=\\langle A,I\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S))\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Interp}_S&\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\langle\\mathfrak A,s\\rangle,y\\rangle:\\exists A,I\\;(\\mathfrak A=\\langle A,I\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)\\land s\\in N_S\\land y=I(s))\\},\\\\\n|\\mathfrak A|&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Carrier}_S(\\mathfrak A)\n\\quad(\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)),\\\\\ns^{\\mathfrak A}&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Interp}_S(\\mathfrak A,s)\n\\quad(\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S),\\ s\\in N_S).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2595,"backlinks":[{"id":"d93cc27ebf4fb0d3","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal L_\\in=\\{\\in,=\\}$，$\\mathrm{KP}$ 与 $\\mathrm{KP}_\\omega$ 是 [[./18-df-kripke-platek-set-theory]] 中的具体句子集。$\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L_\\in)$、$|\\mathfrak A|$、$\\in^{\\mathfrak A}$ 和 $\\models$ 见 [[./18-df-structure]]、[[./18-df-satisfaction]]。"},{"id":"95cd5e4d0506772c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$ 见 [[18-df-structure]]，$\\mathrm{Var}_S$ 见 [[18-df-variable]]。"},{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-85","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-structure]]"},{"id":"23419e8036fb68bd","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)$、$A=|\\mathfrak A|$ 见 [[18-df-structure]]，$\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)$ 见 [[18-df-assignment]]。"},{"id":"01ff954c42fa05a6","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)$、$A=|\\mathfrak A|$ 见 [[18-df-structure]]；$\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)$ 见 [[18-df-assignment]]。"},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-32","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-structure]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-96","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-structure]]"},{"id":"bf01645e59119446","anchor":"ref-94","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-structure|18-df-structure]]"}],"outgoing":["ea75cdbec811405b","adee8e90809320b8"]}